              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuk’ umwana atuvukiye, duhawe umwana w’umuhungu; ubutware buzoba ku bitugu vyiwe: azokwitwa Igitangaza, Umujanama, Imana y’ubushobozi, Data wa twese ahoraho, Umukama w’amahoro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
