        },
        {
          "text": "Ukugwira kw’ubutware bgiwe n’amahoro ntibizogira iherezo, ku ngoma ya Dawidi no ku bgami bgiwe, bibukomeze, bibushigikize guca imanza zibereye n’ukugororoka, uhereye none ugashitsa ibihe vyose. Umwete w’Uhoraho Nyen’ ingabo uzoshitsa ivyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
