              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 19:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni co kizotuma Uhoraho azoca Abisirayeli umutwe n’umurizo, ishami ry’ikigazi n’umubere, ku musi umwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umugabo mukuru w’icubahiro ni we mutwe, kandi kamenyi yigisha ibinyoma ni we murizo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kukw abarōngōra ubu bgoko babuzimiza, kand’ abarōngōwe na bo barahona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni co gitumye Umwami Imana atazonezererwa imisore yo muri bo, kand’ atazoterwa akagongwe n’impfuvyi zo muri bo n’abapfakazi: kukw abantu bose ar’ abatubaha Imana, bakaba inkozi z’ibibi, kandi n’akanwa kose kakavuga ubupfu. Yamara na ho nyene uburake bg’Uhoraho ntiburahwama, arik’ ukuboko kwiwe kuracabānguye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
