              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kukw ibigabitanyo biturira nk’umuriro, utongora imikere n’amahwa, ukadomeka n’ibisaka vyo mw ishamba, bigacika umwotsi wipfundikanya utwaje intunda hejuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
